      doc: '<p>All arguments are converted to Unicode strings.</p>\n<p>Most values are converted simply by using <code>str(value)</code>. An exception is that\nbytes are mapped directly to Unicode code points with same ordinals. This means\nthat, for example, <code>b"hyv\\xe4"</code> becomes <code>"hyvä"</code>.</p>\n<p>Converting bytes specially is new Robot Framework 7.4.</p>',
